From 074f12d72f41bfd1e268237facd8c498c087a66a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Justin <justurn@live.com>
Date: Sun, 11 Oct 2026 21:59:29 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] feat: DoTs only on targets that outlive them; shield is
 defensive (F-219)

- Ability dot_ms (runner fills it from SpellDuration for aura-3 spells): not
  applied or refreshed when the target's time-to-kill (from damage done so
  far) is under half the DoT's duration
- offenseLeft counts a spell only if castable within 2 s (timers, thrift,
  DoT test), so a ticking DoT never keeps a caster idle at range
- priest Power Word: Shield below 50 % health only (mana-hungry)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_019SSuH6gpqY4Kn5Rk9sd149
